<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.6.9">
<l>ūttaik kuḻiyi lamutam pāyvatupō luṅkaḷ</l>
<l>mūttirap piḷḷaiyai yeṉmukil vaṇṇaṉpē riṭṭu</l>
<l>kōttuk kuḻaittuk kuṇālamā ṭittiri miṉō</l>
<l>nāttaku nāraṇaṉ tamaṉṉai narakam pukāḷ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Giving the name of my could hued [lord]</l>
<l rend="indent">to [your] piss [soaked] child,</l>
<l>[it’s] as if you are pouring ambrosia into a pit of filth,</l>
<l>Come together, join hands and whirl about in a riotous dance!</l>
<l>The mother of Nāraṇa, with [a name] worthy of the tongue,</l>
<l rend="indent">will not go to hell.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
